{"id":"637284","name":"包菜炒馕","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/637284/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"包菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"馕","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱姜蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"馕掰小块。","img":"images/637284/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"包菜撕小块洗净沥干。","img":"images/637284/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅预热，倒油，放入葱姜蒜。","img":"images/637284/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入包菜翻炒二分钟。","img":"images/637284/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加盐和生抽调味，炒均匀。","img":"images/637284/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入馕块，炒均匀。","img":"images/637284/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒一分钟。关火，放葱花。","img":"images/637284/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/637284/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}